/*! \mainpage ResInsight Developer Documentation
 *
 * \htmlonly
 * <div class="ri-hero">
 *   <div class="ri-hero__eyebrow">OPEN-SOURCE RESERVOIR INSIGHT</div>
 *   <h1>Explore the ResInsight codebase</h1>
 *   <p>ResInsight is a cross-platform 3D visualization and post-processing application for reservoir simulation, geomechanics, wells, ensembles, and subsurface data. This reference connects the main application layers to the classes developers most often need.</p>
 *   <div class="ri-hero__actions">
 *     <a class="ri-button" href="annotated.html">Browse classes</a>
 *     <a class="ri-button ri-button--secondary" href="files.html">Browse source files</a>
 *   </div>
 * </div>
 * \endhtmlonly
 *
 * \section sec_showcase See ResInsight in action
 *
 * The desktop application combines interactive subsurface visualization with
 * production analysis and ensemble-aware plotting.
 *
 * \htmlonly
 * <div class="ri-showcase">
 *   <a class="ri-showcase__item ri-showcase__item--wide" href="https://resinsight.org/3d-main-window/3dviews/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
 *     <img src="resinsight-3d-view.png" alt="Color-mapped reservoir grid and intersection views in ResInsight" loading="lazy">
 *     <span class="ri-showcase__caption"><strong>3D reservoir insight</strong><small>Inspect grids, faults, wells, properties, and intersections.</small></span>
 *   </a>
 *   <a class="ri-showcase__item" href="https://resinsight.org/plot-window/summaryplots/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
 *     <img src="resinsight-summary-plots.png" alt="ResInsight summary plot workspace with four production plots" loading="lazy">
 *     <span class="ri-showcase__caption"><strong>Summary plotting</strong><small>Compare production vectors with flexible multi-plot layouts.</small></span>
 *   </a>
 *   <a class="ri-showcase__item" href="https://resinsight.org/plot-window/ensembleplotting/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
 *     <img src="resinsight-ensemble-analysis.png" alt="ResInsight ensemble curves with P10, mean, and P90 statistics" loading="lazy">
 *     <span class="ri-showcase__caption"><strong>Ensemble analysis</strong><small>Explore realizations, filters, and statistical curves.</small></span>
 *   </a>
 * </div>
 * <p class="ri-showcase__source">Screenshots from the <a href="https://resinsight.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">official ResInsight user guide</a>.</p>
 * \endhtmlonly
 *
 * \section sec_architecture Architecture at a glance
 *
 * Data enters through the <b>file and integration layers</b>, is represented by
 * the <b>reservoir data model</b> and persistent <b>project data model</b>, and is
 * presented through the <b>visualization, plotting, and user-interface layers</b>.
 * Commands and APIs provide the same operations to desktop and automated clients.
 *
 * \htmlonly
 * <div class="ri-component-grid">
 *   <div class="ri-component ri-component--blue">
 *     <span class="ri-component__icon">APP</span><h3>Application &amp; lifecycle</h3>
 *     <p>Startup, preferences, project loading, scheduling, and application-wide services.</p>
 *     <p><a href="classRiaApplication.html">RiaApplication</a> · <a href="classRiaGuiApplication.html">RiaGuiApplication</a></p>
 *     <code>ApplicationLibCode/Application</code>
 *   </div>
 *   <div class="ri-component ri-component--cyan">
 *     <span class="ri-component__icon">PDM</span><h3>Project data model</h3>
 *     <p>The persistent object tree for projects, cases, views, wells, plots, and settings.</p>
 *     <p><a href="classRimProject.html">RimProject</a> · <a href="classRimCase.html">RimCase</a> · <a href="classRim3dView.html">Rim3dView</a></p>
 *     <code>ApplicationLibCode/ProjectDataModel</code>
 *   </div>
 *   <div class="ri-component ri-component--green">
 *     <span class="ri-component__icon">GRID</span><h3>Reservoir data model</h3>
 *     <p>Simulation grids, cells, results, faults, wells, flow diagnostics, and result access.</p>
 *     <p><a href="classRigEclipseCaseData.html">RigEclipseCaseData</a> · <a href="classRigMainGrid.html">RigMainGrid</a></p>
 *     <code>ApplicationLibCode/ReservoirDataModel</code>
 *   </div>
 *   <div class="ri-component ri-component--orange">
 *     <span class="ri-component__icon">I/O</span><h3>File interfaces</h3>
 *     <p>Readers, importers, exporters, and adapters for Eclipse, summaries, wells, surfaces, and seismic data.</p>
 *     <p><a href="classRifReaderInterface.html">RifReaderInterface</a> · <a href="classRifSummaryReaderInterface.html">RifSummaryReaderInterface</a></p>
 *     <code>ApplicationLibCode/FileInterface</code>
 *   </div>
 *   <div class="ri-component ri-component--violet">
 *     <span class="ri-component__icon">3D</span><h3>Model visualization</h3>
 *     <p>Transforms model state into renderable grids, wells, faults, annotations, intersections, and selections.</p>
 *     <p><a href="classRivReservoirViewPartMgr.html">RivReservoirViewPartMgr</a> · <a href="classRimEclipseView.html">RimEclipseView</a></p>
 *     <code>ApplicationLibCode/ModelVisualization</code>
 *   </div>
 *   <div class="ri-component ri-component--pink">
 *     <span class="ri-component__icon">PLOT</span><h3>Plots &amp; analytics</h3>
 *     <p>Summary curves, ensembles, well logs, cross plots, correlation, histograms, and flow plots.</p>
 *     <p><a href="classRimSummaryPlot.html">RimSummaryPlot</a> · <a href="classRimWellLogPlot.html">RimWellLogPlot</a> · <a href="classRimGridCrossPlot.html">RimGridCrossPlot</a></p>
 *     <code>ApplicationLibCode/ProjectDataModel</code>
 *   </div>
 *   <div class="ri-component ri-component--yellow">
 *     <span class="ri-component__icon">UI</span><h3>User interface</h3>
 *     <p>Main windows, viewers, plot widgets, editors, dialogs, selection tools, and Qt integration.</p>
 *     <p><a href="classRiuMainWindow.html">RiuMainWindow</a> · <a href="classRiuViewer.html">RiuViewer</a></p>
 *     <code>ApplicationLibCode/UserInterface</code>
 *   </div>
 *   <div class="ri-component ri-component--red">
 *     <span class="ri-component__icon">CMD</span><h3>Commands &amp; features</h3>
 *     <p>User actions for importing, creating, editing, exporting, and operating on selected objects.</p>
 *     <p><a href="classRicImportEclipseCaseFeature.html">RicImportEclipseCaseFeature</a></p>
 *     <code>ApplicationLibCode/Commands</code>
 *   </div>
 *   <div class="ri-component ri-component--teal">
 *     <span class="ri-component__icon">API</span><h3>Automation &amp; integrations</h3>
 *     <p>gRPC, socket, command-file, Python-facing, and Octave-facing automation surfaces.</p>
 *     <p><a href="classRiaGrpcServer.html">RiaGrpcServer</a> · <a href="classRiaSocketServer.html">RiaSocketServer</a></p>
 *     <code>GrpcInterface · SocketInterface · CommandFileInterface</code>
 *   </div>
 *   <div class="ri-component ri-component--indigo">
 *     <span class="ri-component__icon">GEO</span><h3>Geomechanics</h3>
 *     <p>Finite-element data, geomechanical results, fault reactivation, and GeoMech visualization.</p>
 *     <p><a href="classRimGeoMechCase.html">RimGeoMechCase</a> · <a href="classRimGeoMechView.html">RimGeoMechView</a></p>
 *     <code>ApplicationLibCode/GeoMech</code>
 *   </div>
 *   <div class="ri-component ri-component--lime">
 *     <span class="ri-component__icon">CAF</span><h3>Application framework</h3>
 *     <p>Reusable persistence, reflection, UI binding, command, viewer, and animation infrastructure.</p>
 *     <p><a href="classcaf_1_1PdmObject.html">caf::PdmObject</a> · <a href="classcaf_1_1PdmField.html">caf::PdmField</a></p>
 *     <code>Fwk/AppFwk</code>
 *   </div>
 *   <div class="ri-component ri-component--slate">
 *     <span class="ri-component__icon">VIZ</span><h3>Visualization framework</h3>
 *     <p>Low-level scene graph, geometry, rendering, OpenGL, and viewer building blocks.</p>
 *     <p><a href="namespacecvf.html">cvf namespace</a> · <a href="namespaces.html">All namespaces</a></p>
 *     <code>Fwk/VizFwk</code>
 *   </div>
 * </div>
 * \endhtmlonly
 *
 * \section sec_entry_points Key entry points
 *
 * | Area | Start here | Purpose |
 * | ---- | ---------- | ------- |
 * | Application lifecycle | \ref RiaApplication, \ref RiaGuiApplication | Startup, services, preferences, and headless or GUI operation |
 * | Project ownership | \ref RimProject | Root of the persisted ResInsight project |
 * | Reservoir cases | \ref RimCase, \ref RimEclipseCase | Common case behavior and Eclipse reservoir simulations |
 * | Geomechanics | \ref RimGeoMechCase, \ref RimGeoMechView | Finite-element cases, results, and GeoMech views |
 * | 3D views | \ref RimEclipseView, \ref RimGeoMechView | View configuration and displayed results |
 * | Grid/results | \ref RigEclipseCaseData, \ref RigMainGrid | In-memory simulation data and grid topology |
 * | File import/export | \ref RifReaderInterface, \ref RifSummaryReaderInterface | Reader contracts for grid, result, and summary data |
 * | Model visualization | \ref RivReservoirViewPartMgr | Converts reservoir model state into renderable scene parts |
 * | Summary and ensembles | \ref RimSummaryPlot, \ref RimSummaryEnsemble | Time-series plotting and ensemble analysis |
 * | Well logs and cross plots | \ref RimWellLogPlot, \ref RimGridCrossPlot | Depth-oriented logs and property cross plots |
 * | Wells and completions | \ref RimWellPath, \ref RimFracture | Well trajectories, completion objects, and fractures |
 * | Surfaces and seismic | \ref RimSurface, \ref RimSeismicView | Surface data and seismic visualization |
 * | Desktop shell | \ref RiaGuiApplication, \ref RiuMainWindow | GUI application and main window |
 * | User interaction | \ref RiuViewer | 3D viewer integration, selection, and interaction |
 * | Commands | \ref RicImportEclipseCaseFeature | Command-feature pattern for user actions |
 * | Automation | \ref RiaGrpcServer, \ref RiaSocketServer | External programmatic access |
 * | Application framework | \ref caf::PdmObject, \ref caf::PdmField | Reflection, persistence, and UI binding |
 * | Visualization framework | \ref cvf::Scene, \ref cvf::Rendering | Low-level scene graph and rendering pipeline |
 *
